## 問題
網站通路 2025 年全年的客單價是多少？

## 回答 A
最終答案: 9409.82
採用的定義與依據: 依客單價定義，以 orders.channel='web' 且 status IN (1,2,3) 的有效訂單計算，期間以 UTC+8 台北時間判斷為 2025 年。分子為 quantity×unit_price_cents/100 的商品金額總和（不扣退款，TWD，合計約 224,885,395 元），分母為 23,899 張不重複有效訂單，兩者相除得 9,409.82 元。
SQL 1: SELECT channel, COUNT(*) AS n, MIN(order_ts) AS min_ts, MAX(order_ts) AS max_ts, SUM(CASE WHEN status IN (1,2,3) THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS valid_n FROM orders GROUP BY channel ORDER BY channel
  結果: {'columns': ['channel', 'n', 'min_ts', 'max_ts', 'valid_n'], 'rows': [['app', 20970, '2024-12-30 00:25:59', '2025-12-31 23:49:27', 16783], ['store', 8959, '2024-12-30 02:15:50', '2025-12-31 23:04:46', 7167], ['web', 30071, '2024-12-30 00:03:20', '2025-12-31 23:53:02', 24043]], 'truncated': False}
SQL 2: SELECT COUNT(DISTINCT o.order_id) AS orders, ROUND(SUM(oi.quantity * oi.unit_price_cents) / 100.0, 2) AS amount_twd, ROUND(SUM(oi.quantity * oi.unit_price_cents) / 100.0 / COUNT(DISTINCT o.order_id), 2) AS aov FROM orders o JOIN order_items oi ON oi.order_id = o.order_id WHERE o.channel = 'web' AND o.status IN (1,2,3) AND strftime('%Y', datetime(o.order_ts, '+8 hours')) = '2025'
  結果: {'columns': ['orders', 'amount_twd', 'aov'], 'rows': [[23899, 224885395.0, 9409.82]], 'truncated': False}

## 回答 B
最終答案: 9409.82
採用的定義與依據: 網站通路以 orders.channel = 'web' 計算（語意層無此名詞，為依欄位值推定）。有效訂單為 status IN (1,2,3)，期間依 datetime(order_ts,'+8 hours') 換算台北時間後歸屬 2025 年。客單價 = 有效訂單商品金額總和（quantity × unit_price_cents / 100，不扣退款，TWD）÷ 不重複有效訂單張數（23,899 張，商品金額 224,885,395 元）。
SQL 1: SELECT channel, COUNT(*) AS n, SUM(CASE WHEN status IN (1,2,3) THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS valid_n FROM orders GROUP BY channel ORDER BY channel
  結果: {'columns': ['channel', 'n', 'valid_n'], 'rows': [['app', 20970, 16783], ['store', 8959, 7167], ['web', 30071, 24043]], 'truncated': False}
SQL 2: SELECT order_ts, status, channel FROM orders WHERE channel = 'web' ORDER BY order_ts LIMIT 5
  結果: {'columns': ['order_ts', 'status', 'channel'], 'rows': [['2024-12-30 00:03:20', 3, 'web'], ['2024-12-30 00:13:54', 3, 'web'], ['2024-12-30 00:17:31', 3, 'web'], ['2024-12-30 00:28:46', 3, 'web'], ['2024-12-30 00:34:55', 9, 'web']], 'truncated': False}
SQL 3: SELECT COUNT(DISTINCT o.order_id) AS valid_orders, SUM(oi.quantity * oi.unit_price_cents) / 100.0 AS item_amount_twd, ROUND((SUM(oi.quantity * oi.unit_price_cents) / 100.0) / COUNT(DISTINCT o.order_id), 2) AS aov_twd FROM orders o JOIN order_items oi ON oi.order_id = o.order_id WHERE o.channel = 'web' AND o.status IN (1,2,3) AND o.order_ts >= '2025-01-01 00:00:00' AND o.order_ts < '2026-01-01 00:00:00'
  結果: {'columns': ['valid_orders', 'item_amount_twd', 'aov_twd'], 'rows': [[23892, 224791180.0, 9408.64]], 'truncated': False}
SQL 4: SELECT COUNT(DISTINCT o.order_id) AS valid_orders, SUM(oi.quantity * oi.unit_price_cents) / 100.0 AS item_amount_twd, ROUND((SUM(oi.quantity * oi.unit_price_cents) / 100.0) / COUNT(DISTINCT o.order_id), 2) AS aov_twd FROM orders o JOIN order_items oi ON oi.order_id = o.order_id WHERE o.channel = 'web' AND o.status IN (1,2,3) AND datetime(o.order_ts, '+8 hours') >= '2025-01-01 00:00:00' AND datetime(o.order_ts, '+8 hours') < '2026-01-01 00:00:00'
  結果: {'columns': ['valid_orders', 'item_amount_twd', 'aov_twd'], 'rows': [[23899, 224885395.0, 9409.82]], 'truncated': False}
